>Find a sink with an altar on the same level.

Doesn't have to be on the same level. Puddings will fall through holes.
So if the sink is a level or two above the altar, then that's OK.

Also for the same reason you'll want to make sure that there are no
level teleport traps, polymorph traps, trap doors, or holes on the
level you are farming.

>Get a figurine of a black pudding and use it on a level with an altar.

Yes. Not blessed or it'll be your pet.

>Keep zapping a wand of create monster until a black pudding is created on 
>a level with an altar.

May take awhile.

One last one. You can use a wand of undead turning on a dead pudding.
I did this once when the sink was two levels below the altar.

>Wield a crappy metal weapon like an orcish dagger.

